    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Divine Diner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Automation \u00d7 Tower Defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ruled by gods and populated by vegetable-people and animal-folk, capitalism has reached its final form. You\u2019ve been \u201cchosen\u201d to cook for the divine elite. Will you serve them loyally, or secretly aid the oppressed masses exiled to the orbital slums?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Kitchen Empire</strong><br>Unlock equipment, expand your workspace, and optimize production in your fully customizable sci-fi kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Faster You Serve, the More You Earn</strong><br>Time is money\u2014deliver dishes quickly to earn generous tips from your divine patrons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve the Gods... or Defy Them</strong><br>Will you obey and prosper, or resist and smuggle resources to help humanity survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest Brains, Craft Robots</strong><br>Extract neural tissue from leftover \u201cingredients\u201d to create obedient robotic workers that lighten your load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep It Clean, or Be Overrun</strong><br>Space roaches are relentless. Maintain cleanliness, or face a full-blown infestation.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Divine Diner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Automation \u00d7 Tower Defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ruled by gods and populated by vegetable-people and animal-folk, capitalism has reached its final form. You\u2019ve been \u201cchosen\u201d to cook for the divine elite. Will you serve them loyally, or secretly aid the oppressed masses exiled to the orbital slums?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Kitchen Empire</strong><br>Unlock equipment, expand your workspace, and optimize production in your fully customizable sci-fi kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Faster You Serve, the More You Earn</strong><br>Time is money\u2014deliver dishes quickly to earn generous tips from your divine patrons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve the Gods... or Defy Them</strong><br>Will you obey and prosper, or resist and smuggle resources to help humanity survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest Brains, Craft Robots</strong><br>Extract neural tissue from leftover \u201cingredients\u201d to create obedient robotic workers that lighten your load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep It Clean, or Be Overrun</strong><br>Space roaches are relentless. Maintain cleanliness, or face a full-blown infestation.</p></li></ul>",
